 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "If you've got a quote for brand-new impact windows sitting in front of you, look at the bottom of it. You're probably being charged for the installation too.",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 6.98
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "Most window companies in South Florida sell you the windows, then hand your job to an outside crew and bill you again to put them in.",
   "t0": 7.3,
   "t1": 13.92
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "That labor line alone can add thousands to your total.",
   "t0": 14.1,
   "t1": 16.9
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "text": "At VistaGuard, installation is free.",
   "t0": 17.14,
   "t1": 19.26
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "text": "Our own crew installs every window we source, so there's no second crew and no separate labor bill.",
   "t0": 19.5,
   "t1": 24.6
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "text": "And because we work directly with the manufacturer instead of buying through a middleman, the windows come in at two to three times less than what most companies will quote you.",
   "t0": 24.86,
   "t1": 32.82
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "text": "We've been installing impact windows in your neighborhood across South Florida for over thirty years, we're licensed and insured, and every job carries a lifetime warranty on our products and materials.",
   "t0": 33.04,
   "t1": 43.02
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Click Get Quote below to book your free in-home inspection and estimate.",
   "t0": 43.42,
   "t1": 46.82
  }
 ]
}